{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23676","headline":"早春同刘郎中寄宣武令狐相公 · 白居易","name":"早春同刘郎中寄宣武令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁园不到一年强，遥想清吟对绿觞。\n更有何人能饮酌，新添几卷好篇章。\n马头拂柳时回辔，豹尾穿花暂亚枪。\n谁引相公开口笑，不逢白监与刘郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}